      51:7. — 7 Nestle, O. C., Ap. Crit. A Jn 9:4. — 8 Lagrange, 
      O.C., P.260. — 9 Suetonio, Vespasiana Vii; Plinio, Nat. Hist. Xxvii 4. — 
      10 Poetae Latini Minores (Ed. Baehreus) Iii N.214ss. — 11 Shabbath 6:5; 
